<title>GREECE: GREEK SARANDOPOULOS SAYS IT HAS ALWAYS PAID TAXES.</title>
<headline>GREEK SARANDOPOULOS SAYS IT HAS ALWAYS PAID TAXES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek construction firm Sarandopoulos said in a statement that it has always paid taxes in full and abided by law.</p>
<p>The firm was participating in two construction consortia featured in a list of tax-evaders submitted to parliament by Finance Minister Yannos Papandoniou on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sarandopoulos said its stake in both consortia was very small and both tax cases had been taken to court. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
